EXPERIMENT ACX-0001
ENGINE ACE-AEON@0.2.0
PARAMETERS {
  ACP-002 = 0.45
  ACP-003 = 0.55
}
END

OBSERVATION ACO-0001
EXPERIMENT ACX-0001
TIME_REAL 4m
TIME_PERCEIVED 30m
AFFECT "calm"
END

RELATION ACR-0001
FROM ACP-002
TO ACS-003
OPERATOR may_increase
EVIDENCE [ACO-0001]
CONFIDENCE weak
END

HYPOTHESIS ACH-0001
IF ACP-002 increases
THEN ACS-003 may_increase
EVIDENCE [ACO-0001]
STATUS experimental
END
